flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> SubmitPost[Author submits post]
    SubmitPost --> Validate{Valid content?}

    Validate -- No --> ShowErrors[Show validation errors]
    ShowErrors --> SubmitPost

    Validate -- Yes --> SaveDraft[Save as draft]
    SaveDraft --> RunSpamCheck[Run spam/profanity check]
    RunSpamCheck --> SpamOk{Passed check?}

    SpamOk -- No --> FlagForReview[Flag for manual review]
    FlagForReview --> AdminReview{Admin decision}
    AdminReview -- Reject --> NotifyRejected[Notify author: rejected]
    NotifyRejected --> End1((End))
    AdminReview -- Approve --> QueuePublish[Queue for publish]

    SpamOk -- Yes --> RequireApproval{Requires editor approval?}
    RequireApproval -- No --> QueuePublish
    RequireApproval -- Yes --> NotifyEditor[Notify editor]
    NotifyEditor --> EditorReview{Editor decision}
    EditorReview -- Reject --> NotifyRejected
    EditorReview -- "Request changes" --> ShowErrors
    EditorReview -- Approve --> QueuePublish

    QueuePublish --> GenerateSlug[Generate URL slug]
    GenerateSlug --> SlugCollision{Slug already exists?}
    SlugCollision -- Yes --> AppendSuffix[Append numeric suffix]
    AppendSuffix --> GenerateSlug
    SlugCollision -- No --> PersistPost[Persist post to database]

    PersistPost --> IndexSearch[Index post in search engine]
    IndexSearch --> InvalidateCache[Invalidate homepage cache]
    InvalidateCache --> Publish[Publish post]

    Publish --> NotifySubscribers[Notify subscribers]
    Publish --> PostToSocial[Cross-post to social channels]
    Publish --> NotifyAuthor[Notify author: published]

    NotifySubscribers --> Join(( ))
    PostToSocial --> Join
    NotifyAuthor --> Join

    Join --> LogAnalyticsEvent[Log publish analytics event]
    LogAnalyticsEvent --> End2((End))

    %% Comment moderation branch, triggered independently after publish
    Publish --> AwaitComments[Await incoming comments]
    AwaitComments --> CommentSubmitted{Comment submitted?}
    CommentSubmitted -- No --> AwaitComments
    CommentSubmitted -- Yes --> CommentSpamCheck{Comment passes spam check?}
    CommentSpamCheck -- No --> AutoRejectComment[Auto-reject comment]
    AutoRejectComment --> AwaitComments
    CommentSpamCheck -- Yes --> HoldForModeration{Author moderation enabled?}
    HoldForModeration -- No --> PublishComment[Publish comment immediately]
    HoldForModeration -- Yes --> NotifyAuthorComment[Notify author of pending comment]
    NotifyAuthorComment --> AuthorDecision{Author decision}
    AuthorDecision -- Approve --> PublishComment
    AuthorDecision -- Reject --> DiscardComment[Discard comment]
    DiscardComment --> AwaitComments
    PublishComment --> NotifyCommentSubscribers[Notify thread subscribers]
    NotifyCommentSubscribers --> AwaitComments
